            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A clothing treating device comprises a frame 1 and a first clothing treating drum and a second clothing treating drum mounted respectively in the frame 1, and further comprising a heat pump system and a mounting platform 3. The mounting platform 3 is fixed in the frame and positioned between the first clothing treating drum and the second clothing treating drum. The heat pump system comprises a compressor 2 fixed on the mounting platform 3.</p>
